          "stage1_text": "ታል ፡ ያሳ የመካከለኛው ይላል",
          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "ሳ -> ስ",
            "reason": "Amharic contrastive particle ያስ ('and what about that one?'), parallel to ያስ on the next line; 6th-order ስ was misread as 4th-order ሳ."
          },
          "uncertain": []
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያስ ከዚህም ልዩ ነው ለማለት",
